      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我看了杂志上刊登的店家地图，发现内容很简略，不太好懂。\n让小栗帽一个人过去可能会找不到……",
      "source_fingerprint": "04fa0d3f2c61dc258c00a37ca92968731427669a1c9c4803235147ce51e14176",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
